      "match_notes": "Tintagel won the toss and decided to bowl first, Roche scoring 218-8 from their 45 overs, H Trethewey with a great knock of 64, supported well by P Theunissen (36) and I Trudgeon (29), J Seldon taking 5-42 for the hosts.<br>In reply Tintagel lost wickets regularly and struggled to build a partnership of note, G Uglow (47) and an unbeaten 49 by J Seldon offering the resistance for Tintagel who ended up 154 a/o. P Trethewey (5-44), P Theunissen (2-22) and H Trethewey (2-23).",
